{"id":"b3f8272a240b0b9f","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree.md","title":"ZFC Topo9 Lindelof Degree","display":"df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree — ZFC Topo9 Lindelof Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree"],"display":"df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree — ZFC Topo9 Lindelof Degree","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree — ZFC Topo9 Lindelof Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\">\\(X,\\tau,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V\\)</span> (topology parameters)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S\\)</span> (subcover-bound predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (typing predicates)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}subcover\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(|\\mathcal V|\\leq\\kappa\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}subcover\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(|\\mathcal V|\\leq\\kappa\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}lindelof\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\;((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}lindelof\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\;((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The degree is the least infinite cardinal bounding subcover size; the helper predicate is itself topology-typed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\tau,\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal U,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S,\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}subcover\\text{-}bound} \\vdash \\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\subseteq\\tau\\;(X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal U\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(|\\mathcal V|\\leq\\kappa\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal V))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo9\\text{-}lindelof\\text{-}degree} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo9LindelofDegree}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\lambda,X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\;((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\mathrm{SubcoverBound}_S(\\kappa,X,\\tau))","display":true}],"bytes":1682,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3732","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree.md|58-df-zfc-topo9-lindelof-degree]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","5fb1c2241d1943d1"]}